  "summary": "I’m a full-stack software engineer with nearly two decades of experience building and supporting mission-critical systems that process millions of dollars in transactions daily. At Arcadia (formerly ENGIE Impact), I design and deliver Azure-based cloud solutions—using Azure Function Apps, Angular, and Terraform—that replace legacy platforms and help clients manage energy, utilities, and sustainability data more efficiently.\n \nI’ve successfully migrated thousands of clients off legacy systems, improved reliability of high-volume payment processing, and automated critical workflows. I actively use AI tools like Claude and GitHub Copilot to speed up development, raise code quality, and expand test coverage. Strong background in C#, SQL, .NET, Angular/TypeScript, and DevOps.\n \nI thrive in Agile/SCRUM environments, value clean and maintainable code, and believe the best solutions come from close collaboration with business stakeholders. I find it rewarding to solve complex problems that deliver real business value. Open to connecting with peers.",
